  "result": "I fixed the bug in `removeMember` in `src/server/services/member-service.ts`. I haven't run the test suite.\n\n`removeMember` called `assertLastOwnerRetained(..., \"owner\")`. That function returns immediately when the next role is `\"owner\"`, so removing an owner never triggered the last-owner check. Demotion passes the real target role, which is why it was still refused correctly.\n\nRemoval now passes `\"viewer\"`, a non-owner role, so the check runs and refuses to remove the last owner.",
